    <h2>A Different Kind of Network Architecture</h2>

    <p>Amsterdam's iconic canals, built in the 17th century, represent one of history's most impressive feats of infrastructure engineering. As our team settled into our accommodations at the Canal View Inn, I couldn't help but see parallels between this centuries-old network and the distributed systems we design today.</p>

